<title>POLAND: DROSED AUG NET RISES TO PLN 1.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>DROSED AUG NET RISES TO PLN 1.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.44 vs   1.40</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.77 vs   1.94</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.57 vs   1.01</p>
<p> Sales		   15.95 vs  10.34</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.35 vs   4.29</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.86 vs   5.68</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.49 vs   4.80</p>
<p> Sales		   88.05 vs  59.65</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish poultry producer is Drosed SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
